只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Right-sidebar workbench for DeepSeek Harness: Obsidian notes, SOP lookup, glossary, recordings with live transcription, global search.","id":"gh:1439976785","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-legal-workbench","slug":"gaog88666-boop/dsh-legal-workbench","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","legal-tech","obsidian","transcription"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Right-sidebar workbench for DeepSeek Harness: Obsidian notes, SOP lookup, glossary, recordings with "},{"id":"p1s2","text":"live transcription, global search."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-legal-workbench"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A right-sidebar workbench for DeepSeek Harness.\nIt turns your Obsidian notes into a working surface "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"inside the chat window: look up SOPs,\nkeep a glossary, record meetings with live transcription and a"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"nnotations, and search everything."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"All files stay on your computer. No account, no telemetry. See PRIVACY.md."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明见 README.zh.md。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Requires** a DSH installation (0.2.0 or newer — check with `dsh --version`) and network access\n(th"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"e package comes from npm)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Pick the command that matches your DSH:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**DSH Desktop app**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**Self-hosted DSH Web** (on your server)"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Using a custom profile name? Replace `desktop` / `web` with yours (see `~/.dsh/profiles/`)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Then **restart DSH** and click the workbench icon next to the session title, or press `⌥W`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"No Obsidian required, no API keys, no account."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"> Fully verified on macOS only. Other platforms install and run, but the two actions that call\n> sys"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"tem commands (\"open in Obsidian\", \"open console\") may need a config tweak."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## First run"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Click the workbench icon next to the session title (or press `⌥W`).\nThe first time, it asks for one "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"thing: the full path of a folder holding your Markdown notes\n(an Obsidian vault, or any folder — the"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" plugin only touches `.md` files).\nFill it in and press save — that's it."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Nothing else is required. The optional extras (transcription, usage badges, Pkulaw points)\nstay dorm"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"ant until you provide your own credentials."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Card | What it does | Needs |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| SOP | Browse your SOP folder as a tree, read and edit notes in place | a vault |\n| Glossary | One "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"row per term, edit inline, written back to a note | a vault |\n| Recordings | Record, transcribe live"},{"id":"p22s3","text":", highlight and annotate the transcript, play back | a vault; transcription needs a Volcengine key |"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"\n| Search | Full-text search across notes, transcripts and annotations | a vault |\n| Email | Draft e"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"mails from your own rule library | optional: your own skill folder |\n| Usage badge | DeepSeek balanc"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"e and remaining speech hours | optional: your own keys |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Where things live"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- Your notes and recordings: inside your vault (folders are configurable on the first screen).\n- Plu"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"gin configuration: `~/.dsh-workbench/config.json`.\n- Optional credentials: `~/.dsh-workbench/asr.jso"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"n` (mode 600, never in this repo)."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Keyboard"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- `⌥W` — open or close the workbench wherever you are\n- `Esc` — close it"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Notes"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- The right sidebar is per-session in DSH. If the workbench cannot dock there, it opens as an\noverla"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"y instead of failing silently.\n- Transcription is off unless you configure a Volcengine key; recordi"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ng and playback work without it."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **The panel opens but stays empty**: click the **refresh** button at the top right of the panel.\nT"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"his is a known first-load issue in 1.1.0; one refresh fixes it.\n- **Clicking the icon does nothing**"},{"id":"p30s3","text":": some sessions have no right sidebar yet, so the workbench\nopens as an overlay instead (shortcut `⌥"},{"id":"p30s4","text":"W`).\n- **It asks you to configure something**: it just needs the folder holding your Markdown notes."},{"id":"p30s5","text":"you to configure something**: it just needs the folder holding your Markdown notes.\nFill it in once."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- **Images in notes are not rendered.** They appear as a filename label (e.g. `图片 photo.png`).\nEvery"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"thing else in a note (headings, lists, bold, code, tables as text, wikilinks) is shown.\n- Markdown s"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"upport is deliberately minimal: no HTML, no embedded PDFs, no mermaid rendering.\n- Annotations ancho"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"r to the **first line** of a multi-line selection.\n- Highlight colour is fixed (yellow); the storage"},{"id":"p32s5","text":" supports more, the UI does not expose it yet.\n- The reimbursement card only checks that a template "},{"id":"p32s6","text":"exists; it does not parse it yet.\n- Transcribing an imported audio file shows no progress bar.\n- The"},{"id":"p32s7","text":" workbench reads and writes the vault directly. Edits made in Obsidian appear after a refresh,\nand e"},{"id":"p32s8","text":"dits made here appear in Obsidian immediately (same files).\n- DSH gives each session its own right s"},{"id":"p32s9","text":"idebar; if the workbench cannot dock there it opens as an\noverlay instead of failing silently."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
